    {
      "type": "info",
      "id": "three-s-words",
      "title": "sensible · sensitive · sympathetic",
      "text": "sensible = разумный, практичный: Be sensible — There are only three places in the car.\nsensitive = чувствительный, легко задеть: Don’t be so sensitive — I didn’t mean to make you cry.\nsympathetic = сочувствующий, понимающий чужие чувства: Be sympathetic — Her hamster has died."
    },
